5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about finding people! I’ll check retained recruiters’ placement times and adviser bench and partner board seats.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,George,,I worry about the stories we tell. We need to see if this plan adds more burden to those doing routine upkeep.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"I’m concerned about how much disruption the timetable absorbs during construction, and whether the finished rooms are actually used afterward.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I’m worried about the timeline. Every project seems to hit unpriced issues, squeezing a year of work into the remaining weeks.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I suspect the approved figures are fiction. I want to see the actual post-occupancy costs versus the original budget estimates.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
